    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is21">
        <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e98">Caput 21</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is21-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e104">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1262C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e108" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_1@1-3">Onus deserti maris.</quote>
            Babylonis, pro multitudine populi dicta mare.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e112">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e114" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_1@9-11">De deserto venit.</quote>
            In quo Dominus tentatus, in quo Israelitae percussi a serpentibus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is21-Dd1e119">
          <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e121">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e123">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e125" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_2@6-7">Qui incredulus.</quote>
            Generalis sententia, quasi culpa singulorum est quod in tempestate opprimuntur.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e129">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e131" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_2@16-17">Ascende Aelam.</quote>
            LXX: Aelamitae et legati Persarum. Aelamitae, despicientes.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e135">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e137" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_2@16-16">Ascende,</quote>
            quasi diceret: O Persae et Medi, nolite timere, equos ascendite, Babylonem obsidete.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e141">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e143" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_2@16-16">Ascende.</quote>
            Dei fortitudine confisus, audacter, contra adversarios loquitur.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e148">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e150" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_2@20-21">Omnem gemitum.</quote>
            Quo te et alias gentes gemere <pb ed="#P" n="1262D"/> faciebat; vel, ut nullus jam gemat pressus potentia Babylonis; vel, tantis malis sit afflicta, ut contra te gemere non audeat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is21-Dd1e157">
          <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e159">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e161">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e163" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_5@1-2">Pone mensam.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e166"><seg type="qs">Quasi diceret: O Persae et Medi, sumite cibum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">in quo ignea tela diaboli restringatis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e174">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e176" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_5@3-3">Contemplare,</quote>
            etc. Quid post mensam ingruat et, vel, contemplare, o Balthasar, quid scripserit in pariete: <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e179">Mane, Tethel, Phares.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is21-Dd1e183">
          <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e185">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e187">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e189" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_6@9-9">Speculatorem.</quote>
            Speculantes dicuntur prophetae.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is21-Dd1e195">
          <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e197">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e199">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e201" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_7@6-6">Ascensorem.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e204"><seg type="qs">Cyrus princeps imperabat Medis et Persis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">litterae scilicet et spiritus ad duo referunt Testamenta.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is21-Dd1e213">
          <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e215">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e217">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1263A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e221" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_8@3-3">Leo.</quote>
            Idem leo pro virtute animi, qui speculator praerogativa contemplationis.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e225">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e227" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_8@4-6">Super speculam Domini.</quote>
            Id est, per diem in contemplatione positus, diebus ac noctibus paratus audire et loqui quae praeceperit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e231">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e233" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_8@19-21">Stans totis noctibus.</quote>
            Ut me custodiam ab omni peccato, ut sim dignus audire verbum Domini.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is21-Dd1e238">
          <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e240">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e242">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e244" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_9@1-5">Ecce iste venit vir.</quote>
            Quod sequitur, se vidisse significat, venire, scilicet Salvatorem super bigam sedentem, et duobus animalibus, id est, asino et camelo, unum currum jungentem.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e248">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e250" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_9@12-13">Cecidit, cecidit.</quote>
            Cyro et Dario Babylonem vastantibus, etiam idola sunt confracta, templo Beli subverso et igne concremato.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is21-Dd1e255">
          <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e257">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e259">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e261" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_10@1-2">Tritura mea.</quote>
            Quasi dicat: O popule, <pb ed="#P" n="1263B"/> qui recondendus es in horrea mea, quem trivi variis angustiis, ut excuterem paleas et triticum purum, conferrem in horrea, quae audivi a Domino ex Deo Israel, etc.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is21-Dd1e268">
          <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e270">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e272">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e274" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_11@1-2">Onus Duma.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e277"><seg type="qs">LXX: Idumaeae</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">onus Duma ad me clamat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e285">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e287" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_11@3-5">Ad me clamat.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is21-Rd1e290"><name xml:id="gom-is21-Nd1e291" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e294"><seg type="qs">Deus, scilicet custos meus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">loquitur deinde gentibus: <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e300" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_12@7-8">Si me quaeritis,</quote> studiosius <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e303" source="http://scta.info/resource/io9">quaerite<!-- check: cited chapter given; verse not identified --></quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is21-Dd1e310">
          <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e312">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e314">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e316" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_12@3-4">Venit mane,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e319"><seg type="qs">Quasi populo meo dabo lumen laetitiae</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">operatione, et sic audiam vos.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is21-Dd1e329">
          <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e331">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e333">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e335" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_13@1-3">Onus in Arabia.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e338"><seg type="qs">Arabes sunt Saraceni</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">inde alloquitur Deus Judaeos fugientes sic:</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e346">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1263C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e350" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_13@4-7">In saltu ad vesperam.</quote>
            O Judaei, qui obsidionem Babyloniam fugietis in saltu, id est in silvis Saracenorum dormietis, fugientes Chaldaeos in semitis Dodanim, quod interpretatur <mentioned>in propinquos</mentioned> vel <mentioned>cognatos</mentioned>, id est, in via quae ducit propinquos vestros Saracenos.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e358">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e360" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_13@7-7">Vesperam.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is21-Rd1e363"><name xml:id="gom-is21-Nd1e364" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e367">Quae est principium noctis. Qui peccare incipit, in vespera est; qui ad summum venit, in media nocte. Media nocte primogenita Aegypti occiduntur. Petrus negat, luce jam vicina poenitet.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e370">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e372" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_13@9-10">In semitis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is21-Rd1e375"><name xml:id="gom-is21-Nd1e376" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e379"><seg type="qs">Quia vespera principium malorum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quando contra patrem rebellavit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is21-Dd1e388">
          <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e390">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e392">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e394" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_14@1-3">Occurentes sitienti ferte.</quote>
            Hoc contra eos potest dici, qui otio et desidiae se tradiderunt et propria salute contenti sunt, nec poenitentibus et conversis manum porrigunt.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e398">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1263D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e402" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_14@2-4">Sitienti ferte aquam.</quote>
            Fatigatis fratribus ardore solis et sitis ferte aquam, ne in solitudine pereant.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is21-Dd1e407">
          <head xml:id="gom-is21-Hd1e409">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e411">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e413" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_16@7-9">Adhuc in uno,</quote>
            etc. Quasi diceret: Quia non habuistis in eos misericordiam, prope sustinebitis captivitatis miseriam. Post annum a Judaica captivitate et Jerusalem subversione, hi quoque vastati sunt.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is21-d1e417">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e419" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is21_16@11-14">Quasi in anno mercenarii:</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is21-Rd1e422"><name xml:id="gom-is21-Nd1e423" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is21-Qd1e426"><seg type="qs">quod est: Quomodo mercenarius annum suum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">panemque coelestem comederint.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
